Z||000012||DaRkLoRD||06-29-2000||04:56 PM||||Scott, I already have most of the companies listed on my website.. for free.. it'd seem like kind of a ripoff to the vendors if I were to charge them for it.. I'd feel like I was cheating them. I suppose I could make a more detailed ad page though..<P>Monkeyman.. ok, I emailed you.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I'm not totally sure what I'll end up doing regarding the advertising.. the cards are costing me a fair bit of cash. $250 CDN plus S/H.. but at least they're waterproof..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>I still need 2 or 3 more sponsors. but I'm not going to email anyone else until I decide how I'm going to display the ads.. <P>this stuff is confusing.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
